WEBVTT

NOTE Edited transcription of a historical recording. Unclear speech is marked; use current specifications for ordering.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.400
How to select a painted hardwood in 2020.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:14.800
Initially select maple species and the paint
color of your choice.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:25.300
Accept the catalog style.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:30.000
Then click Species in the Style column.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.300
Select Unset.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.000
Then click Close.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.200
Highlight one cabinet in your drawing that is in
the correct catalog.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.200
Within the local browser, begin typing the
species you would like to change the catalog

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.500
to.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.600
Then double-click on the species.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:59.500
to the catalog selection, you will see your
species has been inserted into the catalog

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.200
style.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:07.800
When you are ready to print the order, select
the presentation tab, reports, and WW Wood

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.400
products order form.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.200
out the form completely and click View.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:48.400
Your order will now have the corrected species
line plus the paint line.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:02:00.400
Note the species markup and paint markup will
apply to the accessories section as well.

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:04.400
Thank you for watching.
